    "category": "Recursion",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given an N \u00d7 M grid where 0 represents a blocked cell and 1 represents an open cell, count the total number of distinct paths from the top-left cell to the bottom-right cell. You may move only Right and Down through open cells.",
